 "title": "Base change of universal homeomorphisms",
 "statement": "Base changes of universal homeomorphisms\n[def-weil-pbc-scheme-conventions] are universal homeomorphisms.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-curve-estimates/sk-prop-cd/lem-weil-pbc-universal-homeomorphism-base-change.md",
